OL,3,GNEWSALitter pick collects 50 bags of
OL,4,Arubbish from river
OL,5,
OL,6,FA litter picking group which removes
OL,7,Frubbish from a river collected more
OL,8,Fthan 50 bags of rubbish at their latest
OL,9,Fgathering.
OL,11,FThe Durham City Riverscape Community
OL,12,Fformed just before the coronavirus
OL,13,Fpandemic to carry out monthly litter
OL,14,Fpicks along the River Wear.
OL,16,FThe group estimated it had collected
OL,17,Ftonnes of waste from the water since
OL,18,Fthe start, including a large fridge
OL,19,Fearlier this year.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
