OL,3,GNEWSALitter pick collects 50 bags of
OL,4,Arubbish from river
OL,5,
OL,6,FLead volunteer Graham Hollingwood said
OL,7,Fthe group was approaching the 1,000 bag
OL,8,Fmilestone which "just shows how much
OL,9,Fwork goes into protecting our
OL,10,Friverbanks" and the "phenomenal"
OL,11,Fefforts of volunteers.
